# T1 (TIMING, one arm of the paired ABAB T1 control, T2 shared history, T3 control, T4 shared history): the CONTROL arm: the production profile c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix, audits off. The two profiles differ by the flag alone at run time (the ledger the -4e
# profile names is already on in the image). READ per pair, PAIRED per round, never against the other pair and never by an unpaired median: the eight-seat round timeline from the server log (the verify
# phases, the '[PACKED-GDN-AFTER-PAIRS]' flush lines, round_ms: c2_serving_gate.flag_phase_rounds with live=8) and concurrent8_steady tokens a second per user; the accepted-token sequences
# and the concurrent8_code_equal hashes must be identical between the arms. A busy host skews every host phase: check the load average around each run. WHY: block B's claim moves block A's four commit
# traces ahead of the drafts (0 to +2.2 ms a round by the research, unmeasured); this is the measurement. KILL RULE: a pair whose median round is more than 1.5 ms slower than its control's means the
# sharing is memory-only: NO-GO for traffic on its own (the GO rule in ORDER.txt). Duration (estimate): attach 18 + warm-up, coding and the steady shape about 17 = 35 min. SOFT (data); T3 and T4 repeat
# T1 and T2 so that one noisy pair cannot decide.
# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the exact-GDN-memory pack (tp4/gdn-shared-history; scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it): copy it over
# .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of the integration branch and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN. Nothing here names a rig, a card, a host or a registry:
# the cards are resolved at run time. ORDER.txt has the order, stop rules, minutes, NEEDS and the GO rule. ONE IMAGE FOR THE WHOLE WINDOW: C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-gdn4e-1 stands for
# the combined window's one image (the integration step replaces it in every template of every pack); a commit of a file the image carries needs a new build and a new tag.
# The cards are under development: no agentstop, agentstart or hand-back job exists in this pack. The arms are run by the gate harness only: nothing here serves traffic.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset smoke
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-gdn4e-1
C2_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix
C2_SMOKE_TESTS=warmup,coding,concurrent8_steady,concurrent8_code_equal
